!data/models/intent-distilbert/
data/models/intent-distilbert/_checkpoints/
# The weights themselves are a GitHub Release asset, not a git object: 256 MB is
# past GitHub's 100 MB file limit, and LFS gives only ~4 clones/month of free
# bandwidth. intent/classifier.py downloads this on first run. Everything else
# in the directory (config, tokenizer — 783 KB) IS committed, so a clone has
# everything but the one big tensor file.
data/models/intent-distilbert/model.safetensors

