# Conversation transcripts — private by definition, never commit
data/transcripts/

# Design docs JANET writes about its own changes — local proposals, not history
docs/janet_changes/

# Captured utterances from JANET_DEBUG_AUDIO — your voice, never commit
data/debug_audio/

# Saved alarms, timers and reminders — your schedule, and machine-local state
data/state/
src2/

# One-off scripts holding real personal data (a school timetable, an address
# book). The rest of tools/ is tracked and pushed, so anything with your
# teachers' names or your employer in it belongs here instead.
tools/private/